# 9. Computer Control API

Deadpool should expose a small set of powerful primitives.

## Application

```text
launch_app(app)
focus_app(app)
close_app(app)
get_open_apps()
get_windows()
```

## Window

```text
focus_window(window)
maximize_window(window)
minimize_window(window)
close_window(window)
```

## Mouse

```text
move_mouse(target)
click(target)
double_click(target)
right_click(target)
drag(source, destination)
scroll(direction, amount)
```

## Keyboard

```text
press_key(key)
hotkey(keys)
type_text(text)
```

## Browser

```text
open_url(url)
back()
forward()
refresh()
get_current_url()
```

## Observation

```text
get_active_window()
get_ui_tree()
get_screen()
find_element()
```

## Files

```text
list_directory()
find_file()
open_file()
```

File modification must have its own permission layer.

