# 31. State Machine

Implement:

```text
IDLE
 ↓
UNDERSTANDING
 ↓
OBSERVING
 ↓
PLANNING
 ↓
WAITING_PERMISSION
 ↓
EXECUTING
 ↓
VERIFYING
 ├── SUCCESS → COMPLETED
 ├── RECOVERABLE → OBSERVING
 └── FAILURE → FAILED
```

This should be explicit in code.

