# 47. The Most Important Architectural Rule

Do NOT build:

```text
"Open Chrome" → special code

"Open Notepad" → special code

"Open Antigravity" → special code

"Open terminal in Antigravity" → special code

"Open terminal in VS Code" → special code

"Open terminal in Cursor" → special code
```

Build:

```text
                 DEADPOOL
                     │
                     ▼
                  GOAL
                     │
                     ▼
                OBSERVE
                     │
                     ▼
                  REASON
                     │
                     ▼
             SELECT GENERIC ACTION
                     │
          ┌──────────┼───────────┐
          ▼          ▼           ▼
        APP         UI         INPUT
      control     control      control
          │          │           │
          └──────────┼───────────┘
                     ▼
                  VERIFY
                     │
                     ▼
                   DONE
```

That is the fundamental difference between a **command automation program** and a **general-purpose desktop agent**.

