# 48. Final Product Definition

Deadpool should ultimately feel like:

> **"Tell me what you want done on the computer. I'll figure out how to do it."**

Not:

> **"Tell me one of the commands I have been programmed to recognize."**

The first is the architecture this document specifies.

The ultimate system is:

```text
             ┌─────────────────────────┐
             │       DEADPOOL          │
             │                         │
             │       Qwen 1.7B         │
             │          BRAIN          │
             └────────────┬────────────┘
                          │
             ┌────────────▼────────────┐
             │     AGENT RUNTIME       │
             │                         │
             │ Goal → Observe → Plan  │
             │ Act → Verify → Recover  │
             └────────────┬────────────┘
                          │
          ┌───────────────┼────────────────┐
          │               │                │
          ▼               ▼                ▼
       Windows           Browser        Filesystem
       UI/API            Control          Control
          │               │                │
          └───────────────┼────────────────┘
                          │
                 ┌────────▼────────┐
